cing=0 width=95%><tr><td bgcolor=#000000><table border=0 width=100% cellpadding=5 cellspacing=1><tr><td valign=top bgcolor=#636347 class=headings><font color=#fcfefd>Author</font></td><td valign=top bgcolor=#636347 class=headings><font color=#fcfefd>Comment</font></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uursaboldrunt.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Ursa Boldrunt</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(7/29/01 4:41:57 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=63.topic>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Raid on 8-31-01</span><hr size=1> I thought it would be fun to have a raid on Fri. Aug 31.  It's<br>
far inadvance, but some of us have to schedule our lives a<br>
month in advance and it gives time for the word to get out.<br>
I'll be talking to people on-line and send out a reminder.<br>
I'm very open to ideas.    My initial idea was alts. around<br>
low 30's.     I know this doesn't work for the high level <br>
people, I'm trying to stimulate our level (lowbies).     If there<br>
are not enough Golden Legion, others would be welcome.<br>
If you have ideas about where to go that would be a <br>
challenge w/o killing us, I would love to hear it.     How about<br>
8 pm  CST?  I'm thinking of FM, the Temple of Droga or <br>
the Mines of Nurga.     I'm open to thoughts.<br>
<br>
Ursa Boldrunt, hobbit cousin of Meakkon <p></p><i>Edited by: <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uursaboldrunt.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Ursa Boldrunt</A> at: 7/29/01 4:48:41 pm<br></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uaantboldrunt.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Aant Boldrunt</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Administrator</span><br> <font color=#330000>(7/29/01 4:48:43 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=63.topic&index=1>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Raid on 8-31-01</span><hr size=1> Sounds good, I think those areas are rarely camped.  Plus there is a bind point nearby for the weaker classes.  <p>Aant Boldrunt, hobbit druid and wise cousin of Meakkon the Bold</p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uazlinnspiritfyre.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Azlinn Spiritfyre</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(8/5/01 7:11:06 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=63.topic&index=2>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Raid on 8-31-01</span><hr size=1> i am abit high for the raid your talking about but interested in it and got a couple sugestions like unrest sol a  maybe a little of mm  places like that anyway im in if its ok<br>
 <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uursaboldrunt.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Ursa Boldrunt</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(8/11/01 6:08:49 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=63.topic&index=3>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Raid on 8-31-01</span><hr size=1> Azlinn,   anybody and anyplace is great.   By the end of the<br>
month who knows what level we will be.       I just happen<br>
to see a group of us who happen to be around a groupable<br>
level (Roda, Aant, Theo, his mom, Twos).     Not that this<br>
is just for us.      Since, you're higher, you probably know<br>
some good places.     I'm interested in your suggestions.<br>
 <p>Ursa Boldrunt, hobbit cousin of Meakkon the Bold</p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uaantboldrunt.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Aant Boldrunt</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Administrator</span><br> <font color=#330000>(8/31/01 9:03:00 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=63.topic&index=4>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Raid on 8-31-01</span><hr size=1> Raid will be to Mines of Nurga.  Roda and I scouted it last night and found 3 blues past waterfall to us at 35.  Zone was empty.  I died once when camo wore off, we almost died a second time, but got evac off.  Entrance was one way so would either need to fight way through (no) or gate/evac/port out (yes).<br>
<br>
With exp bonus of 12 percent this could be nice exp to camp for 29-42 level (rough estimate).  With harmony and snare/root (to prevent adds), should be doable with one group of 4-6.  Risky, though due to the unknown, but that's what makes gave fun.  Big advantage -- something different. <p>Aant Boldrunt, hobbit druid and wise cousin of Meakkon the Bold</p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uazlinnspiritfyre.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Azlinn Spiritfyre</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(8/31/01 11:41:13 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=63.topic&index=5>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Raid on 8-31-01</span><hr size=1> Im still interested in going. <p></p><i></i></td></tr></table> </td></tr></table> <table border=0 width=95%><tr><td align=left valign="top"> </td><td align=right valign="top"><a href="http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showNextMessage?topicID=63.topic"> Next Topic >> </a><br><br><a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=63.topic&index=5><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/themes/traditional/addReply.jpg border=0 alt="Add Reply"></a> </td></tr></table><br><table width=95% border=0><td valign="top"> <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.emailToFriend?topicID=63.topic><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/image/email.gif border=0 alt="Email This To a Friend"> Email This To a Friend</a><br> <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.threadControl?topicID=63.topic><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/themes/traditional/deleteThread.gif border=0 alt="Topic Control Image"> Topic Commands (Moderator only)</a><br> <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.subscribeUnregisteredToTopic?topicID=63.topi